"The Path of Exceptionalism grants Advanced Attributes that quicken every Path, Class Paths included, and its second Tier evolves Talented into Gifted."
"The Path of the Completionist gains steps for every Path its holder completes; its third Tier gives an extra Affinity slot and its fourth an extra Advanced Attribute slot."
"The Path of Soulstealing is a mutated Path that no Achievement can add steps to; only the soul fragments of a demon-ridden creature dying nearby advance it."
"The first Tier of Soulstealing improves its holder's Aether Core a grade, and the second improves their Aether Channels a grade."
"Completing three Paths beyond the rudimentary before the age of six earns the Path of Exceptionalism, and a child who already has it gets steps instead."
"A Pacted Path comes of a pact with a demon or a spirit, and a demon cult's members trade evil acts for such Paths."
